951 to 2025. September to October and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 44% of normal in November to December and 71% in October to November. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 42% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
